d}5x-2y=7 \\\\ 8x+y=7\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "This system can be written as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 \\\\ 8 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 \\\\ 8 & 1\\end{aligned}].$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{5\\cdot 1-(-2)\\cdot 8}[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ -8 & 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{21}[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ -8 & 5\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{21}[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ -8 & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-32141/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c89778fa-3c8d-5f0a-a0f8-c9b3d9193ffd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-32141"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-102705/selection/6805611550604499166ab5c12f8b3c655a5497680000c2d5fcbf03a9b33c736b" :answer/id #uuid "2b946cbc-ba6a-5d77-9082-330ea43c303d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102705/selection/8ea34a8b532879378573061371e24fe2d1d78b8d20c3d409cd18832513489142" :answer/id #uuid "a1d043da-6f7b-55c1-b88b-ff8128a46618" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=2[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102705/selection/665a4bf6aa514532ac53bdedf15908c94b29a33396eccb92154f9ee368312cdf" :answer/id #uuid "e02d476b-35b4-58af-8881-8011cee132f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned